## Executing User-Defined Skills

Skills execute with their own persona and instructions loaded from the database.

### Execution Flow
1. Load skill configuration (inputs, outputs, instructions, persona)
2. Validate all required inputs are provided
3. Execute skill with its configured persona
4. Capture defined outputs for downstream use

### Input Validation
- Check all required inputs are present
- Validate input types match skill definitions
- Report missing inputs before execution

### Output Capture
- Capture outputs as defined in skill configuration
- Store outputs in execution context
- Make outputs available for subsequent steps

### Error Handling
- Report skill execution failures clearly
- Include which inputs were provided
- Suggest fixes for common issues
